    The attribute IDs to copy from originator node into target node.
    If null or not included, all will be copied. If set to an empty array, none will be copied
    """
    attributeIds: [UUID!]
    """
    The observation IDs to copy from originator node into target node.
    If null or not included, all will be copied. If set to an empty array, none will be copied
    """
    observationIds: [UUID!]
    """
    The activity IDs to copy from originator node into target node.
    If null or not included, all will be copied. If set to an empty array, none will be copied
    """
    activityIds: [UUID!]
    """
    The relationship IDs to copy from originator node into target node.
    If null or not included, all will be copied. If set to an empty array, none will be copied
    """
    relationshipIds: [UUID!]
    """
    The comment IDs to copy from originator node into target node.
    If null or not included, all will be copied. If set to an empty array, none will be copied
    """
    commentIds: [UUID!]
    """
    The assessment IDs to copy from originator node into target node.
    If null or not included, all will be copied. If set to an empty array, none will be copied
